    "detailed_description": "<strong>Altered Algorithm: Episode 1</strong> is a free VR experience introducing you back to a time of gaming simplicity and the excitement of unique experiences. This project has been in development for only 6 months by a small team of developers (including me, Nick DePalo), a community of amazing artists, and a group of filmmaking partners. We hope to build on this foundational endeavor of episodic adventures with your support. Our goal is to introduce new, interesting, and unique experiences to the world. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261930/extras/89c28d34b0335f7ede042eea82575186.avif?t=1720990807\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261930/extras/c66433c0bd380d556847b1bb2b8d5197.poster.avif?t=1720990807\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261930/extras/c66433c0bd380d556847b1bb2b8d5197.webm?t=1720990807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261930/extras/c66433c0bd380d556847b1bb2b8d5197.mp4?t=1720990807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Welcome to an alternate LA, set in a futuristic 1983. You're either a militant or mercenary. <br><br>Jeremiah, our main protagonist lives in an alternate past where technology has already flourished for decades causing ALL risk to be mitigated. He's a hired &quot;Field Adjuster&quot; who's job is to hunt down any threats to make the world &quot;SAFE&quot; through the use of the most advanced AI Predictive software and Threat Analytics ever created with a new government program called... CASSI.<br><br>\u200bCASSI, a &quot;<strong>C</strong>entralized<strong> A</strong>I <strong>S</strong>afety <strong>S</strong>urveillance<strong> I</strong>nfrastructure&quot; is designed to serve, mitigate, and protect everyone and everything.<br><br>\u200bWhen the A.I. Threat Algorithm Jeremiah relies on is infiltrated by Kenji Kimora, an infamous underground gang leader, an altered simulation unfolds, and it causes a system city lockdown beyond repair. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261930/extras/288a07901396d405813b6b2cbb3c6065.poster.avif?t=1720990807\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261930/extras/288a07901396d405813b6b2cbb3c6065.webm?t=1720990807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261930/extras/288a07901396d405813b6b2cbb3c6065.mp4?t=1720990807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>These events lead Jeremiah to embark on a journey within the simulation to explore the deep city slums of gangs, freewill, and the chaos of choice to discover the <strong>altered algorithm</strong> of who he truly is and needs to become. <br><br>There, Jeremiah is presented with the greatest risk ever encountered.... <strong>himself</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261930/extras/c041929502a2e55449cab8c27fa883a7.avif?t=1720990807\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261930/extras/9bed86bbc4241839f4d2ca7743dc186b.poster.avif?t=1720990807\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261930/extras/9bed86bbc4241839f4d2ca7743dc186b.webm?t=1720990807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261930/extras/9bed86bbc4241839f4d2ca7743dc186b.mp4?t=1720990807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Action-thriller set in an altered futuristic timeline of 1983 LA, where advanced technology has already flourished for decades\u200b</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Unique FMV (Full Motion Video) environments and characters that allow dynamic interaction within the real-time 3D world</li></ul>\u200b<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>&quot;Natural Narrative&quot; driven pacing is at the heart of our experience. The choices you make will dynamically unfold the story you drive forward. SEARCH, SOLVE, or SURVIVE... the choice is yours.\u200b</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Environmental puzzles that involve the player to use their detective tools, the sandbox world, or weapons on hand to manipulate and solve the world's mysteries</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261930/extras/dacaf27f6bdf26a45ffc3a764353fd7f.avif?t=1720990807\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261930/extras/4c9b4b1b33fd12461f83805cb53521f4.poster.avif?t=1720990807\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261930/extras/4c9b4b1b33fd12461f83805cb53521f4.webm?t=1720990807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261930/extras/4c9b4b1b33fd12461f83805cb53521f4.mp4?t=1720990807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Players assume the first-person perspective of a fully playable character in VR known as Jeremiah, who can interact within a world of FMV (Full Motion Video) characters and elements by solving environmental puzzles and options for ranged combat, which reveals your story's journey.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Altered Algorithm: Episode 1</strong> is a free VR experience introducing you back to a time of gaming simplicity and the excitement of unique experiences. This project has been in development for only 6 months by a small team of developers (including me, Nick DePalo), a community of amazing artists, and a group of filmmaking partners. We hope to build on this foundational endeavor of episodic adventures with your support. Our goal is to introduce new, interesting, and unique experiences to the world. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261930/extras/89c28d34b0335f7ede042eea82575186.avif?t=1720990807\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261930/extras/c66433c0bd380d556847b1bb2b8d5197.poster.avif?t=1720990807\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261930/extras/c66433c0bd380d556847b1bb2b8d5197.webm?t=1720990807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261930/extras/c66433c0bd380d556847b1bb2b8d5197.mp4?t=1720990807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Welcome to an alternate LA, set in a futuristic 1983. You're either a militant or mercenary. <br><br>Jeremiah, our main protagonist lives in an alternate past where technology has already flourished for decades causing ALL risk to be mitigated. He's a hired &quot;Field Adjuster&quot; who's job is to hunt down any threats to make the world &quot;SAFE&quot; through the use of the most advanced AI Predictive software and Threat Analytics ever created with a new government program called... CASSI.<br><br>\u200bCASSI, a &quot;<strong>C</strong>entralized<strong> A</strong>I <strong>S</strong>afety <strong>S</strong>urveillance<strong> I</strong>nfrastructure&quot; is designed to serve, mitigate, and protect everyone and everything.<br><br>\u200bWhen the A.I. Threat Algorithm Jeremiah relies on is infiltrated by Kenji Kimora, an infamous underground gang leader, an altered simulation unfolds, and it causes a system city lockdown beyond repair. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261930/extras/288a07901396d405813b6b2cbb3c6065.poster.avif?t=1720990807\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261930/extras/288a07901396d405813b6b2cbb3c6065.webm?t=1720990807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261930/extras/288a07901396d405813b6b2cbb3c6065.mp4?t=1720990807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>These events lead Jeremiah to embark on a journey within the simulation to explore the deep city slums of gangs, freewill, and the chaos of choice to discover the <strong>altered algorithm</strong> of who he truly is and needs to become. <br><br>There, Jeremiah is presented with the greatest risk ever encountered.... <strong>himself</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261930/extras/c041929502a2e55449cab8c27fa883a7.avif?t=1720990807\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261930/extras/9bed86bbc4241839f4d2ca7743dc186b.poster.avif?t=1720990807\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261930/extras/9bed86bbc4241839f4d2ca7743dc186b.webm?t=1720990807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261930/extras/9bed86bbc4241839f4d2ca7743dc186b.mp4?t=1720990807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Action-thriller set in an altered futuristic timeline of 1983 LA, where advanced technology has already flourished for decades\u200b</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Unique FMV (Full Motion Video) environments and characters that allow dynamic interaction within the real-time 3D world</li></ul>\u200b<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>&quot;Natural Narrative&quot; driven pacing is at the heart of our experience. The choices you make will dynamically unfold the story you drive forward. SEARCH, SOLVE, or SURVIVE... the choice is yours.\u200b</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Environmental puzzles that involve the player to use their detective tools, the sandbox world, or weapons on hand to manipulate and solve the world's mysteries</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261930/extras/dacaf27f6bdf26a45ffc3a764353fd7f.avif?t=1720990807\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261930/extras/4c9b4b1b33fd12461f83805cb53521f4.poster.avif?t=1720990807\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261930/extras/4c9b4b1b33fd12461f83805cb53521f4.webm?t=1720990807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261930/extras/4c9b4b1b33fd12461f83805cb53521f4.mp4?t=1720990807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Players assume the first-person perspective of a fully playable character in VR known as Jeremiah, who can interact within a world of FMV (Full Motion Video) characters and elements by solving environmental puzzles and options for ranged combat, which reveals your story's journey.",
